libarchive 3.8.11 and the compression libraries it uses that macOS has no headers for.
All C sources are upstream and unmodified; files not needed on macOS arm64 were left out.

libarchive 3.8.11   https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive/releases/tag/v3.8.11
                    libarchive-3.8.11.tar.xz sha256 a3dc0872b1b39da34dc18ef1b944f0f11ffd37425d70ae04be679279f1cf43d2
                    Sources/CArchive/libarchive: libarchive/*.c and *.h without the Windows, FreeBSD,
                    Linux and SunOS files. config.h is generated by its CMake on macOS 27.2 with
                    OpenSSL, mbedTLS, Nettle, libb2, PCRE, LZO and expat off; hashes and zip
                    encryption use CommonCrypto, libxml2 (xar), zlib, bzip2 and iconv come from the SDK.
zstd 1.5.7          https://github.com/facebook/zstd/releases/tag/v1.5.7
                    zstd-1.5.7.tar.gz sha256 eb33e51f49a15e023950cd7825ca74a4a2b43db8354825ac24fc1b7ee09e6fa3 (matches upstream .sha256)
                    Sources/CZstd/lib: common, compress, decompress (no x86 assembly, no legacy formats,
                    no dictBuilder), multithreaded.
lz4 1.11.1          https://github.com/lz4/lz4/releases/tag/v1.11.1
                    lz4-1.11.1.tar.gz sha256 683fed08a844ad012196381e40badf80c0bbe4962959761416d41c9e67d77ec7
                    Sources/CLZ4/lib: lz4, lz4hc, lz4frame, xxhash (namespaced LZ4_).
xz 5.8.4            https://github.com/tukaani-project/xz/releases/tag/v5.8.4
                    xz-5.8.4.tar.xz sha256 4ce24038fd4221e0d13bc1a2de7a4db56e90b92b3bf75321f6c14be73f65de4b
                    Sources/CLZMA/src: liblzma and the tuklib files its CMake build compiles; the
                    defines in Package.swift are the ones that CMake build used.

Ours: Package.swift, the module.modulemap files, Sources/CArchive/include, this file, Tests.
Licences: COPYING / LICENSE in each Sources folder (libarchive BSD, zstd BSD, lz4 BSD, liblzma 0BSD).
To update: replace the sources from a newer release, regenerate config.h (cmake as above,
copy build/config.h), update the lists in Package.swift and this file, run swift test.
